<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>YouTube Creators - How to make money on YouTube</title>
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    margin:0;
    color:#0f0f0f;
    background:#fff;
    font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.48;
  }
  .btn{cursor:pointer}
  header{
    height:68px;
    border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    padding:0 24px;
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:20;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.97);
  }
  .brand{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    width:226px;
    font-size:20px;
    font-weight:700;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .ytmark{
    width:34px;
    height:24px;
    border-radius:7px;
    background:#ff0000;
    margin-right:7px;
    position:relative;
    display:inline-block;
  }
  .ytmark:after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:13px;
    top:6px;
    border-left:10px solid #fff;
    border-top:6px solid transparent;
    border-bottom:6px solid transparent;
  }
  nav{display:flex;align-items:center;height:100%;gap:58px}
  nav a{
    text-decoration:none;
    color:#555;
    font-size:14px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  nav a:hover{color:#111}
  .nav-arrow{font-size:15px;margin-left:5px}
  .search{
    margin-left:auto;
    width:24px;
    height:24px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .search:before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    width:12px;height:12px;
    border:2px solid #111;border-radius:50%;
    left:1px;top:1px;
  }
  .search:after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    width:8px;height:2px;
    background:#111;
    transform:rotate(48deg);
    left:13px;top:15px;
  }

  .hero{
    width:850px;
    height:480px;
    margin:66px auto 0;
    border:1px solid #f0f0f0;
    text-align:center;
    padding-top:20px;
  }
  .hero img{width:78px;height:78px;object-fit:contain}
  h1{
    font-size:68px;
    line-height:1.08;
    letter-spacing:-2px;
    margin:28px auto 34px;
    max-width:790px;
    font-weight:700;
  }
  .hero p{
    max-width:620px;
    margin:0 auto;
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.5;
  }

  .partner{
    width:1024px;
    margin:145px auto 0;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:74px;
    align-items:start;
  }
  h2{
    font-size:36px;
    line-height:1.15;
    margin:0 0 37px;
    letter-spacing:-.8px;
  }
  .partner-copy p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 30px}
  .partner-image{
    width:100%;
    height:360px;
    object-fit:contain;
    object-position:center top;
  }
  .faq{margin-top:29px}
  .faq-item{border-top:1px solid #bbb}
  .faq-item:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid #bbb}
  .faq-title{
    min-height:70px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    font-size:21px;
  }
  .faq-title span:last-child{font-size:22px;color:#666}
  .faq-content{
    display:none;
    color:#666;
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.55;
    padding:0 0 26px;
  }
  .faq-item.open .faq-content{display:block}
  .faq-item.open .faq-title span:last-child{transform:rotate(180deg)}
  .faq-content p{margin:0 0 24px}
  .faq-content ul{padding-left:28px;margin:0 0 26px}
  .faq-content li{padding-left:3px;margin:0 0 20px}
  .link{
    color:#1769c2;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-weight:600;
  }

  .earn{
    width:1024px;
    margin:160px auto 0;
  }
  .section-intro{text-align:center}
  .section-intro h2{margin-bottom:30px}
  .section-intro p{
    width:620px;
    margin:0 auto 22px;
    font-size:18px;
    line-height:1.5;
  }
  .fineprint{
    color:#777!important;
    font-size:15px!important;
    width:650px!important;
  }
  .ways{margin-top:76px}
  .way{
    border-top:1px solid #aaa;
  }
  .way:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid #aaa}
  .way-head{
    height:72px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:24px;
    font-size:21px;
  }
  .num{
    width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;
    background:#eee;
    color:#666;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;
    flex:none;
  }
  .way.open .num{background:#d20b13;color:#fff}
  .way-head .chevron{
    margin-left:auto;
    font-size:19px;
    color:#666;
    transition:transform .2s;
  }
  .way.open .chevron{transform:rotate(180deg)}
  .way-body{
    display:none;
    padding:22px 0 42px;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:44px;
    align-items:start;
  }
  .way.open .way-body{display:grid}
  .way-body img{
    width:100%;
    height:280px;
    object-fit:contain;
    object-position:left top;
  }
  .way-body p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 22px}

  .next{
    text-align:center;
    margin:170px auto 140px;
  }
  .next h2{margin-bottom:28px}
  .next p{font-size:18px;max-width:680px;margin:auto}

  @media(max-width:900px){
    header{padding:0 15px}
    .brand{width:auto;margin-right:25px}
    nav{gap:18px}
    nav a:nth-child(2),nav a:nth-child(4){display:none}
    .hero,.partner,.earn{width:calc(100% - 40px)}
    .hero{height:auto;padding:28px 20px 48px}
    h1{font-size:48px}
    .partner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px;margin-top:90px}
    .partner-image{height:300px}
    .way-body{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="brand btn"><span class="ytmark"></span><span>YouTube Creators</span></div>
  <nav>
    <a class="btn" href="#welcome">Welcome, Creators</a>
    <a class="btn" href="#partner">Partner Program</a>
    <a class="btn" href="#earn">How things work <span class="nav-arrow">⌄</span></a>
    <a class="btn" href="#questions">Top questions</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="search btn" aria-label="Search"></div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero" id="welcome">
    <img src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/030.svg" width="78" height="78" alt="Money illustration">
    <h1>How to make money<br>on YouTube</h1>
    <p>When it comes to turning your ideas into income, you’ve got options.<br>
    From traditional ads to selling merchandise to memberships for your fans, there<br>
    are a lot of ways to use your channel and videos to make money.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="partner" id="partner">
    <div class="partner-copy">
      <h2>YouTube Partner Program</h2>
      <p>There are so many formats available to make content on YouTube, such as Shorts, live streaming and long-form video, and we want to make sure Creators can get rewarded for making all of them. The YouTube Partner Program lets qualifying Creators tap into different ways to earn revenue, as well as gives access to resources like 1:1 support and the Copyright Match Tool. Creators are building successful businesses of their own with employees and full-fledged operations and are a significant share of the more than $50B we’ve paid out to creators, artists and media companies over the last three years.</p>

      <div class="faq" id="questions">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-title btn"><span>Are you eligible?</span><span>⌄</span></div>
          <div class="faq-content">
            <p>To qualify for the YouTube Partner Program, you need to be in good standing with YouTube, follow all the <a class="link btn" href="#">YouTube monetization policies</a>, and live in a country/region where the <a class="link btn" href="#">YouTube Partner Program is available</a>.</p>
            <p>Creators in <a class="link btn" href="#">these countries/regions</a> are now able to qualify for the YouTube Partner Program sooner:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Apply to the program and unlock benefits like fan funding and select YouTube Shopping features at the following eligibility criteria:
                <ul><li>500 subscribers with 3 public uploads in the last 90 days, and either 3K valid public watch hours in the last 12 months OR 3M public Shorts views in the last 90 days.</li></ul>
              </li>
              <li>Unlock even more benefits including revenue sharing from ads and YouTube Premium when you hit:
                <ul><li>1,000 subscribers and either 4K valid public watch hours in the last 12 months OR 10M valid public Shorts views in the last 90 days.</li></ul>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>All creators will go through a standard review process upon applying to ensure their channel meets our policies and guidelines. Some features may have additional eligibility criteria.</p>
            <p><a class="link btn" href="#">Learn more about the YouTube Partner Program ↗</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-title btn"><span>The benefits of being in the YouTube Partner Program</span><span>⌄</span></div>
          <div class="faq-content">
            <p>The YouTube Partner Program is a comprehensive partner program available to Creators, delivering support, monetization opportunities and more. Once you’re in the program, you can start earning money from ads on long-form videos, ads between short-form videos and from YouTube Premium subscribers watching your content. You can also use Shopping to offer products to your audience and access Fan Funding revenue streams including Super Chat, Super Thanks, Super Stickers and channel memberships. What’s more, creators in the program are guaranteed access to our Creator Support team with one-to-one help over email and chat and automatic copyright flags of reuploaded content through the Copyright Match Tool. We’re always exploring ways to make the YouTube Partner Program the most rewarding and supportive experience for our Creators.</p>
            <p><a class="link btn" href="#">Read more about how to earn money on YouTube ↗</a></p>
            <p><a class="link btn" href="#">Read about the ads algorithm ↗</a></p>
            <p><a class="link btn" href="#">Get Creator Tips on the YouTube Partner Program ↗</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <img class="partner-image" src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/006.jpg" width="600" height="360" alt="YouTube Partner Program">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="earn" id="earn">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <h2>Multiple ways to earn</h2>
      <p>Learn your options for earning money on YouTube, explore what makes the<br>most sense for your channel and start earning.</p>
      <p class="fineprint">*Subject to terms and conditions, which may be different based on region. Eligibility<br>requirements and territory restrictions apply.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ways">
      <div class="way open">
        <div class="way-head btn"><span class="num">01</span><span>Ad revenue &amp; YouTube Premium</span><span class="chevron">⌃</span></div>
        <div class="way-body">
          <img src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/013.webp" width="520" height="280" alt="How ads work on YouTube">
          <div>
            <p>Earn ad revenue from display, overlay, and video ads that run on your channel. With YouTube Premium, you can earn a portion of a subscriber’s fee when they watch your content.</p>
            <a class="link btn" href="#">Get Creator Tips for how ads work ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="way">
        <div class="way-head btn"><span class="num">02</span><span>Super Chat &amp; Super Stickers</span><span class="chevron">⌄</span></div>
        <div class="way-body"><div></div><p>Give your fans a way to interact with you during live streams and premieres.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="way">
        <div class="way-head btn"><span class="num">03</span><span>YouTube Shopping</span><span class="chevron">⌄</span></div>
        <div class="way-body"><img src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/009.jpg" width="520" height="280" alt="YouTube Shopping"><p>Showcase products and make it easy for viewers to shop directly from your content.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="way">
        <div class="way-head btn"><span class="num">04</span><span>Channel Memberships</span><span class="chevron">⌄</span></div>
        <div class="way-body"><div></div><p>Offer members exclusive perks, content and community experiences.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="way">
        <div class="way-head btn"><span class="num">05</span><span>YouTube BrandConnect</span><span class="chevron">⌄</span></div>
        <div class="way-body"><div></div><p>Connect with brands and discover opportunities for sponsored content.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="way">
        <div class="way-head btn"><span class="num">06</span><span>Super Thanks</span><span class="chevron">⌄</span></div>
        <div class="way-body"><img src="__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/012.jpg" width="520" height="280" alt="Super Thanks"><p>Let viewers show appreciation for your videos with a one-time purchase.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="next">
    <h2>What’s next?</h2>
    <p>Curious to learn more? Keep exploring the tools and tips that will help keep your<br>channel growing, plus the guidelines that protect and empower Creators.</p>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-title').forEach(function(el){
    el.addEventListener('click',function(){
      el.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');
    });
  });
  document.querySelectorAll('.way-head').forEach(function(el){
    el.addEventListener('click',function(){
      el.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');
    });
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
